 break a 3.8.0 deployment, how to upgrade a Helm release step by step and how to validate the result.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-62/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0",{"_61":436},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","en:upgrades",{"_195":439},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-arrow-up shrink-0 text-[#c8861f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 12-4-4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16V8\"></path></svg>",{"_35":442,"_42":54,"_37":443,"_48":444,"_57":-7,"_11":445,"_59":446},"en:security.mdx","Security","How to report a security vulnerability in Lamassu privately, what to include in a report and which releases receive security fixes.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-62/security",{"_61":447},"security.mdx","fallback"]
